# LLLRouter

Personal local AI gateway dashboard. This repository hosts **release builds only** —
the application source is not published here.

## Install

Download `lllrouter-<version>.tgz` from [Releases](../../releases) and install it globally:

```bash
npm install -g ./lllrouter-0.1.0.tgz
lllrouter
```

Then open <http://127.0.0.1:20228>.

## Requirements

Node.js >= 20.9 (22.5+ recommended — it uses the built-in `node:sqlite`).

## Options

```
-p, --port <port>   port to listen on (default 20228, env PORT)
    --host <host>   interface to bind (default 127.0.0.1, env HOSTNAME)
-v, --version       print version
-h, --help          print help
```

The dashboard has no login, so the default bind is loopback only — pass
`--host 0.0.0.0` to expose it on your network.

## Data

Settings, providers, keys and usage live outside the package:

- Windows: `%APPDATA%\lllrouter`
- macOS / Linux: `~/.lllrouter`

Override with `DATA_DIR`. Copying `db/data.sqlite` moves an existing setup to
another machine.

